      "value": "I completely agree. Maybe they added that feature the way they did to test it out. Or maybe testing a way to limit dynamic bones generally for the upcoming quest version. For PC users it's completely normal to just have friends show their avatars with all the features. But for quest users it might simply be way too much. So they might need to set a limit for quest users if they don't want them to complain about performance",
