      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The best option would be to add it to the safety menu where you can toggle on and off various things according to ranks. That way you can turn off dynamic bones for everyone except friends, saving a lot of performance especially in public worlds.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
