  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-03-28T01:00:06.869Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The limitation on dynamic bones is fine, but I think it should be off for friends. \n\nCreating this all or nothing thing where you either have uncheck it in a hard to find menu box or deal with stiff looking avatars from everyone doesn’t really cater to a good expietence.\n\nAllow people to self regulate their performance. if I click on someone and do “show avatar” I would prefer all their avatar components(including dynamic bones) to be visable) instead of then having to go into a separate menu.",
